   - Entropy change: \((0.39 - 0.29)/0.29 \approx 34.5\%\) increase.

   This is again a good trade but now **we also have to respect that progress is already flat**. Going beyond 2 exploration points (Option 3) to 3 exploration points (Option 2) may be too aggressive in shifting the batch away from direct improvement:
