     R \approx \frac{K}{|\text{CTE}|},\quad 
     \Delta R \approx \frac{\Delta K}{|\text{CTE}|} - \frac{K\,\Delta|\text{CTE}|}{|\text{CTE}|^2}.
     \]
   - At the current best: CTE ≈ 0.058, K ≈ 1.622 →  
