   So moving from pure exploitation (O0) to more exploratory batches (O2–O5) reduces expected hypervolume improvement by roughly 6–27%.

6. **Relative Entropy (Information Gain) Comparison**  
   We can also normalize Entropy by the maximum (Option 4 = 0.66):
   - O0: 0.46 / 0.66 ≈ 0.697  
