3. **EHVI vs Exploration Tradeoff (Quantitative)**  
   Define for each option i:
   - \( \text{EHVI}_i \): expected hypervolume improvement  
   - \( H_i \): “entropy” (mutual information) proxy  
   We have:
   - Option 0: EHVI = 0.2736,  H = 0.16,  (5 opt / 0 explore)
   - Option 1: EHVI = 0.2431,  H = 0.15,  (4 / 1)
