   - Each option this iteration costs the same ($500), so the decision reduces to the quality/character of the points (EHVI vs exploration/entropy), not budget.

2. **Objective structure and current best**  
   - Goal: maximize \( \frac{K}{|\text{CTE}|} \).  
   - Best observed:  
     - CTE = \(1.406\times 10^{-4}\)  
     - K = 2.902  
     - Ratio \(R_\text{best} = \frac{2.902}{1.406\times 10^{-4}} \approx 2.0635\times 10^4\), consistent with the reported 20635.081.  
