   - With a sharp objective like \(R = K / |\text{CTE}|\), the *value of local information* near a good incumbent can be very high: narrowing uncertainty can quickly reveal steep improvements (e.g., tuning compositions that reduce CTE from 0.040 to 0.020 doubles R if K stays similar).  
