   \]
   For Option 2 to dominate Option 0:
   \[
   -0.0695 + 0.03\lambda > 0 \Rightarrow \lambda > \frac{0.0695}{0.03} \approx 2.32
   \]

   Interpretation:
   - You would need to value one unit of entropy at >14% of one unit of EHVI for Option 1 to be preferable, and at >232% for Option 2.  
