     - Entropy: 0.05 vs 0.07 (slight info advantage for 2, but as above, requires λ > 2.69 to justify; current phase suggests λ closer to ~1 or below).  
   - Among options 0–2, **Option 0 is Pareto-favorable over 1, and only slightly dominated on entropy by 2 while clearly better on EHVI**.

