   - \(U_4 = 0.1980 + 0.03 = 0.2280\)  
   - \(U_5 = 0.0895 + 0.02 = 0.1095\)

   Even with equal weighting of utility from exploitation and information, Option 0 is best. If we weight EHVI more heavily than entropy (which is appropriate at this stage), Option 0’s advantage increases.

