   - Target metric: maximize K / |CTE|. The current best is at:
     - CTE = -0.2758 (desirable: more negative magnitude → smaller |CTE| not necessarily; we want small |CTE|, but here “minimize CTE” is stated; assuming lower CTE is better and sign is consistent)  
