4. **Balancing exploitation vs exploration mathematically**  
   Define a normalized exploitation score \(E_i\) and exploration score \(I_i\):

   - \(E_i = \text{EHVI}_i / \max_j \text{EHVI}_j\)  
     - Max EHVI = 1.0711 (Option 0).  
     - \(E_0 = 1.0711 / 1.0711 = 1.000\)  
