     \text{EHVI}_0 = \max_i \text{EHVI}_i,\quad \text{Ent}_0 = \max_i \text{Ent}_i
     \]
     which is a rare dominance pattern:  
     \[
     (\text{EHVI}_0, \text{Ent}_0) \succ (\text{EHVI}_i, \text{Ent}_i) \; \forall i \neq 0.
     \]

5. **Discounting marginal EHVI loss vs exploration gain**  
   - Comparing Option 0 vs 1 and others:  
     - Opt1 EHVI = 1.8305 is only ~1.7% below Opt0, but its entropy is 0.04 vs 0.17.  
