   Define a simple composite utility function for this decision step:
   \[
   U = \text{EHVI} - \lambda \cdot \Delta H
   \]
   where \(\Delta H\) is the difference in entropy from a baseline and \(\lambda\) is the per-unit-entropy penalty when progress is accelerating (we value exploitation more).  
