     | 5      | 0, 5                 | 0.3809 | 0.05    |

   - Relative EHVI loss vs pure exploitation (Option 0):
     - Option 1: \( \Delta \text{EHVI} = 0.8038 - 0.7858 = 0.0180 \approx 2.2\% \text{ reduction} \)
     - Option 2: \( \approx 10.4\% \text{ reduction} \)
     - Option 3: \( \approx 23.4\% \text{ reduction} \)
     - Option 4: \( \approx 22.5\% \text{ reduction} \)
