     - Opt 2: 0.0278 (3 opt + 2 exp)  
     - Opt 3: 0.0204  
     - Opt 4: 0.0127  
     - Opt 5: 0.0013  
   - Relative to Option 0, the reduction in EHVI is:  
     - Opt 1: −0.0040 (≈ −10.6%)  
     - Opt 2: −0.0101 (≈ −26.7%)  
     - Opt 3: −0.0175 (≈ −46.2%)  
     - Opt 4: −0.0252 (≈ −66.5%)  
     - Opt 5: −0.0366 (≈ −96.6%)  
