   - Relative (%) loss vs pure exploit (Option 0):
     - Option 1: 0.0209 / 0.1528 ≈ 13.7%  
     - Option 2: 0.0227 / 0.1528 ≈ 14.9%  
     - Option 3: 0.0432 / 0.1528 ≈ 28.3%  
     - Option 4: 0.0546 / 0.1528 ≈ 35.7%  
     - Option 5: 0.0816 / 0.1528 ≈ 53.4%  

