   \[
   \text{Trend} = \frac{R_{\text{recent}} - R_{\text{prev}}}{R_{\text{prev}}} \times 100\% \approx 1.2878 \times 10^4 \%
   \]
   That massive positive derivative in performance indicates that exploitation of the newly found region is currently very high-yield.

3. **Runway calculation**:  
   - Remaining budget ≈ \$4000 total, current iteration 12, ≈8 iterations left.  
