   - Exploration (mutual information) improves the joint posterior over both CTE and K, which is especially important in a 5D simplex where composition–property relationships may be strongly nonlinear and multi-modal.
   - With ≈55 points still to go, investing in model refinement (higher entropy) now is expected to pay off in later iterations with more precise high-EHVI exploitation moves.

