   Compute **relative EHVI loss** vs Option 0:  
   \[
   \Delta E_i = \frac{E_0 - E_i}{E_0}.
   \]  
   - Option 1: \(\Delta E_1 \approx \frac{0.9990 - 0.9440}{0.9990} \approx 5.5\% \) loss  
   - Option 2: \(\Delta E_2 \approx 8.7\%\) loss  
   - Option 3: \(\Delta E_3 \approx 11.4\%\) loss  
