     \]
   - Option 0 gives ~13–15% more EHVI than modestly exploratory options (1–2), and >2× the EHVI of pure exploration (5). Given fixed cost and time per batch, maximizing EHVI is the rational choice unless exploration offers a clear future upside signal (it doesn’t here; see step 5).

4. **Use of trend information (momentum)**  
   - Recent trend: accelerating (+6.8%) in the last 3 vs previous 3 iterations.  
