   Normalized (relative to per-column maxima):
   - EHVI_max = 0.1053 (Option 0)  
     \[
     \text{EHVI}_{\text{rel}}(i) = \frac{\text{EHVI}(i)}{0.1053}
     \]
     - O0: 1.000  
     - O1: 0.974  
