     - O4: 1.000  
     - O5: 0.667  

4. **Constructing a dynamic balance metric**  
   With plateaued improvement and ~50% runway remaining, we should slightly favor exploration but still value EHVI strongly. Define a composite score:
   \[
   S(i) = w_{\text{EHVI}}\cdot \text{EHVI}_{\text{rel}}(i) + w_{\text{Ent}}\cdot \text{Ent}_{\text{rel}}(i)
   \]
   Choose weights to reflect:
   - We still prioritize near-term improvement: \(w_{\text{EHVI}} = 0.6\)  
   - But give more weight to information than if progress were steadily improving: \(w_{\text{Ent}} = 0.4\)

   Compute per option:

