   - Define a simple normalized utility per option using linear scaling across observed ranges:  
     - EHVI range: min = 0.0073, max = 0.0546  
       \( U_\text{EHVI}(i) = \frac{\text{EHVI}_i - 0.0073}{0.0546 - 0.0073} \).  
     - Entropy range: min = 0.08, max = 0.19  
       \( U_\text{Ent}(i) = \frac{\text{Ent}_i - 0.08}{0.19 - 0.08} \).  
   - For Option 1:  
