     - \( U_\text{Ent}(1) = \frac{0.19 - 0.08}{0.11} = 1.0 \).  
     - Any convex combination \( \lambda U_\text{EHVI} + (1-\lambda) U_\text{Ent} \) with \( \lambda \in [0,1] \) gives 1.0 for Option 1 and < 1.0 for all others.  
   - Under any reasonable weighting between exploration and exploitation consistent with our campaign phase, Option 1 is Pareto‑optimal and strictly best.

