     | Option | #opt | #expl | EHVI   | Entropy |
     |--------|------|-------|--------|---------|
     | 0      | 5    | 0     | 0.9393 | 0.14    |
     | 1      | 4    | 1     | 0.9062 | 0.20    |
     | 2      | 3    | 2     | 0.8810 | 0.24    |
     | 3      | 2    | 3     | 0.8922 | 0.10    |
     | 4      | 1    | 4     | 0.8078 | 0.16    |
     | 5      | 0    | 5     | 0.5458 | 0.20    |

   - Relative to Option 0:
     - Option 1:  
       - ΔEHVI = 0.9062 − 0.9393 = −0.0331 (≈ −3.5%)  
       - ΔEntropy = 0.20 − 0.14 = +0.06 (≈ +42.9%)
     - Option 2:  
       - ΔEHVI = 0.8810 − 0.9393 = −0.0583 (≈ −6.2%)  
       - ΔEntropy = 0.24 − 0.14 = +0.10 (≈ +71.4%)
     - Option 3:  
