   \[
   \mathbb{E}[\Delta \text{score}] \approx \text{EHVI}_\text{opt} - \lambda \cdot \text{Var}_\text{model}
   \]
   where λ encodes our need for reducing long-term uncertainty (exploration).  
   - Early campaign: large Var ⇒ λ high; exploration worth substantial EHVI sacrifice.  
   - Late campaign (current): Var already reduced in regions of interest due to 85 points; effective λ is low.  
