6. **EHVI–Entropy Tradeoff (Quantitative Balancing)**  
   Conceptually, consider a simple scalarized utility:
   \[
   U = \alpha \cdot \text{EHVI} + \beta \cdot \text{Entropy},
   \]
   with \(\alpha\) representing emphasis on direct improvement and \(\beta\) on information gain.

   - Given:  
