   - For convenience, define an “information-adjusted” desirability score as a simple product (heuristic, not literal objective):  
     \[
     S_i = \text{EHVI}_i \times \text{Entropy}_i
     \]
     to combine gain in objective space (EHVI) and learning about the response surface (entropy).
