   - Opt 1: 0.3035 / 0.3440 ≈ 0.882 (≈11.8% lower)
   - Opt 2: 0.2932 / 0.3440 ≈ 0.852 (≈14.8% lower)
   - Opt 3: 0.2665 / 0.3440 ≈ 0.775 (≈22.5% lower)
