   A plausible adaptive rule emerging from this decision:
   - Let Δ be the percentage improvement in best score over the last window (e.g., 3 iterations).  
   - Let ρ be the ratio of EHVI(Option 0) − EHVI(Option k) to EHVI(Option 0), i.e.,
