6. **Comparative evaluation of options (multi-criteria)**  
   Construct a simple scalarized heuristic per option:
   \[
   U = \alpha \cdot \text{EHVI} + (1 - \alpha) \cdot \text{Entropy}
   \]
   with \(\alpha\) capturing preference for near-term improvement. Given:  
