   The marginal loss in EHVI by moving away from Option 0 is:  
   - Option 1: ΔEHVI = 0.3398 − 0.3253 = 0.0145 (≈4.3% decrease)  
   - Option 2: ΔEHVI = 0.3398 − 0.3096 = 0.0302 (≈8.9% decrease)  
