   - Improvements in expected hypervolume improvement (EHVI) are our best proxy for expected gain in the Pareto front, and thereby for improvements in \(R\).

2. **Runway & Budget Use**  
   - Remaining iterations ≈ 17; remaining points ≈ 85 (5 points/iteration feasible).  
