5. **Constructing a simple scalarized decision utility**  
   At this stage (early-mid campaign, improving trend, ample runway), a reasonable scalarization for decision-making is:
   \[
   U_i = w_{\text{EHVI}} \cdot \text{RelEHVI}_i + w_{\text{Ent}} \cdot \text{RelEntropy}_i
   \]
   with a bias toward exploitation but non-negligible exploration, e.g. \( w_{\text{EHVI}} = 0.7, w_{\text{Ent}} = 0.3 \).  

   Computing \( U_i \):  
