2. **Objective structure and what “optimize vs explore” means here**  
   - Goal: maximize \( R = \dfrac{K}{|\text{CTE}|} \). Current best:  
     - CTE = −0.01246 → \(|\text{CTE}| = 0.01246\)  
     - \(K = 4.503\)  
     - \(R_{\text{best}} \approx \dfrac{4.503}{0.01246} \approx 361.47\) (matches given best score).  
