     - Option 0:
       \[
       S_0' = 0.6\cdot0.6285 + 0.4\cdot0.04 = 0.3771 + 0.016 = 0.3931
       \]

     - Option 1:
       \[
       S_1' = 0.6\cdot0.5519 + 0.4\cdot0.14 = 0.33114 + 0.056 = 0.38714
       \]

