     → Option 0 clearly dominates.

   - For \(\lambda = 0.5\) (relatively exploration-favoring):  
     - \(U_0 = 0.1054 + 0.5\cdot0.53 = 0.1054 + 0.265 = 0.3704\)  
     - \(U_1 = 0.1049 + 0.5\cdot0.17 = 0.1899\)  
     - \(U_2 = 0.0986 + 0.5\cdot0.21 = 0.2036\)  
     - \(U_3 = 0.0843 + 0.5\cdot0.17 = 0.1693\)  
