   We compare EHVI (exploitation-leaning) vs Entropy (information gain / exploration):

   - Option 0: EHVI = 0.0364, Entropy = 0.54  (5 opt / 0 exp)
   - Option 1: EHVI = 0.0348, Entropy = 0.41  (4 opt / 1 exp)
   - Option 2: EHVI = 0.0333, Entropy = 0.37  (3 opt / 2 exp)
