     \[
     H_5 \approx 0.03 \ll H_2 = 0.14,\quad \text{EHVI}_5 \ll \text{EHVI}_2
     \]

8. **Why not Option 3? (2 opt + 3 explore)**  
   - Option 3 has **lower entropy (0.01)** than even Option 0 (0.03), despite being labeled “more explore”, which indicates the specific candidate points selected for that exploration are in **already well-known regions**.  
