4. **Acquisition metrics comparison (EHVI vs Entropy)**  
   - EHVI ≈ expected improvement toward Pareto front; Entropy ≈ information gain.  
   - Options summary:  
     - Opt 0: EHVI 0.0455, Ent 0.11 (max exploit, low info)  
     - Opt 1: EHVI 0.0458, Ent 0.21  
