   To compare trade-offs, scale each metric to [0, 1].

   EHVI range: [min = 0.0023, max = 0.0728], span = 0.0705  
   - EHVI\*_i = (EHVI_i − 0.0023) / 0.0705  

   Entropy range: [min = 0.02, max = 0.13], span = 0.11  
