   - Option 0 offers the highest EHVI but nearly minimal entropy.  
   - Historically, multiple uses of Option 0 (Iterations 2, 6, 8, 10) did not raise the best score above 7.312, indicating exploitation is largely re-sampling near the same region of the 5D HEA composition space.  
