3. **Objective landscape interpretation**  
   - Goal metric = \( \text{Score} = \dfrac{K}{|\text{CTE}|} \).  
   - Best point:  
     - CTE = -0.01246 → \(|\text{CTE}| = 0.01246\)  
     - K = 4.503  
     - So:  
       \[
       \text{Score}_{\text{best}} = \frac{4.503}{0.01246} \approx 361.4
       \]  
