   We can think of a simple scalarization:
   \[
   S = \lambda \cdot \text{EHVI} + (1-\lambda)\cdot \text{Entropy}
   \]
   With plateauing progress but ample runway, a moderate exploration weight is reasonable, say \(\lambda \approx 0.7\).

