         = 0.30996 + 0.045
         \approx 0.3550
     \]

   Under this simple scalarization, **Option 0 is clearly best**. Even if we tilt weights more towards information (e.g., \(\alpha = 0.6, \beta = 0.4\)), Option 0 still wins because it has both high EHVI and the highest entropy.

