6. **Combined Acquisition Logic (EHVI + Information Gain)**  
   - We want to balance exploitation (high EHVI) and exploration (high entropy). A simple scalarized decision heuristic is:
     \[
     J(\text{option}) = \alpha \cdot \text{EHVI} + \beta \cdot \text{Entropy}
     \]
     with \(\alpha > \beta > 0\) because current progress is accelerating and improvement is still large, so exploitation is higher priority.  
   - Use qualitative weights, e.g., \(\alpha = 1\), \(\beta = 0.3\) (consistent with “prefer more optimization” under accelerating trend):

     - Option 0: \(J_0 = 1 \cdot 0.6265 + 0.3 \cdot 0.21 \approx 0.6265 + 0.063 = 0.6895\)  
