     - Option 2: \(J_2 = 0.5922 + 0.3 \cdot 0.20 \approx 0.5922 + 0.060 = 0.6522\)  
     - Option 3: \(J_3 = 0.5754 + 0.3 \cdot 0.16 \approx 0.5754 + 0.048 = 0.6234\)  
     - Option 4: \(J_4 = 0.5724 + 0.3 \cdot 0.11 \approx 0.5724 + 0.033 = 0.6054\)  
     - Option 5: \(J_5 = 0.5093 + 0.3 \cdot 0.23 \approx 0.5093 + 0.069 = 0.5783\)

   - Even with a non-trivial weight on exploration (β = 0.3), **Option 0 still yields the highest combined score**.  
