3. **Information-efficiency assessment (EHVI vs Entropy)**  
   - EHVI (expected hypervolume improvement) here measures exploitation-weighted benefit (direct objective improvement).  
   - Mutual information / entropy indicates exploratory benefit (model uncertainty reduction).  
