   For more exploration weight (e.g., \( \alpha = 0.5 \)), Option 1 is even more favored:
   - \( U_0 = 0.5(0.2432 + 0.22) = 0.2316 \)
   - \( U_1 = 0.5(0.2425 + 0.24) = 0.24125 \)

