     \[
     U_i = \alpha \cdot \text{EHVI}_i + (1-\alpha) \cdot \beta \cdot H_i
     \]
     with \( \alpha \in [0,1] \) capturing emphasis on improvement vs information, and β a scaling constant to normalize magnitudes.  
