   Option 0 has the **highest EHVI** by a clear margin (0.6463 vs next-best 0.5601).

5. **Utility Trade-off Quantification**  
   Define a simple scalarized decision utility for option \(i\):
   \[
   U_i = \alpha \cdot \text{EHVI}_i + \beta \cdot \text{Entropy}_i 
   \]
   Given:  
