   - Iterations 2 & 3 used Option 1 and eventually yielded a new best score of 5.163 at iteration 3.  
   - The plateau is not strong evidence that Option 1 is ineffective; rather, it likely indicates local saturation in currently explored neighborhoods. Option 1, with 1 explore point per batch, continues to:
     - Push along the modeled Pareto frontier (4 optimize points)  
