5. **EHVI–Entropy Tradeoff per Option**  
   To compare tradeoffs, consider normalized contributions. Taking Option 0 as a purely exploit baseline:

   - Relative EHVI vs Option 0:
     - Opt 0: \(E_0 = 0.1157\) (100%)  
     - Opt 1: \(E_1 / E_0 \approx 0.0988 / 0.1157 \approx 0.854\) (≈85% of max exploitation)  
     - Opt 2: \(E_2 / E_0 \approx 0.716\)  
     - Opt 3: \(E_3 / E_0 \approx 0.718\)  
     - Opt 4: \(E_4 / E_0 \approx 0.480\)  
