REASONING: Option 2 provides the highest EHVI while maintaining substantial entropy, matching our mid-runway, accelerating-progress regime where we should favor mild exploitation tempered with non-trivial exploration to avoid premature convergence and to continue improving the K/|CTE| ratio.
