     - CTE* = -0.01246, K* = 4.503  
     - R* = 4.503 / 0.01246 ≈ 361.5 (matches given 361.470).  
   - R is *highly nonlinear* in CTE near 0 due to 1/|CTE|: a modest reduction in |CTE| near zero produces a very large gain in R.  
